electron-updater against the public GitHub releases feed (build.publish):
background download, one 'Restart now / On next quit' dialog on
update-downloaded, autoInstallOnAppQuit, 4h recheck, fail-silent with the
notify banner as manual fallback. Releases must now ship the zip + blockmap +
latest-mac.yml alongside the DMGs.

The intentional backend restart in nemesis:llm:sync no longer surfaces the red
'Backend stopped' notification (suppressNextBackendExit consumes the child's
exit exactly once) — first sign-in on beta.5 flashed it at every fresh install.
---
 apps/desktop/electron/main.ts | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 apps/desktop/package.json     |  3 +-
 package-lock.json             | 89 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

